<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady, compared to last week's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs</p>
<p>80.00-88.00; 600-700 lbs 74.50-80.50; 700-800 lbs 70.00-78.00,</p>
<p>including 27 head 783 lbs 78.00 blacks. Holsteins - Large 2</p>
<p>300-400 lbs 63.00-71.00; 400-500 lbs 60.00-67.50; 500- 600 lbs</p>
<p>63.50-70.00; 34 head 600 lbs 64.25.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs</p>
<p>71.50-77.75; 600-700 lbs 62.00-71.50; 700- 800 lbs</p>
<p>61.50-69.00.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts - 1,050</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
